@startuml
!include style.iuml
title AD-2: Requirement Analysis, Baseline Approval, Methodology and Timeline (WF-06, WF-07)
|Student or Team Leader|
start
|System|
:Check that an idea is selected or submitted;
|AI Supervisor|
:Analyze idea: functional and non-functional requirements,\nconstraints, dependencies, objectives;
|Student or Team Leader|
:Optionally provide additional requirements;
|AI Supervisor|
repeat
  :Detect missing or unclear requirements;
  :Ask clarification questions;
  |Student or Team Leader|
  :Answer clarification questions;
  |AI Supervisor|
  :Refine analysis;
repeat while (Critical gap remains?) is (yes)
:Define scope, measurable deliverables\nand acceptance criteria;
|System|
:Store draft requirements document;
|Student or Team Leader|
repeat
  :Review and edit requirements;
repeat while (Approved?) is (no)
|System|
:Store approved requirements as versioned baseline;
|Student or Team Leader|
repeat
  :Provide deadline, daily availability, team size,\nmember skills, constraints, resources, complexity;
  |System|
  :Validate inputs (deadline in the future);
  |AI Supervisor|
  :Evaluate inputs;
  :Recommend Agile/Scrum, Kanban or Waterfall\nwith explanation;
  :Generate timeline: phases, dates, durations,\nmilestones, dependencies;
  |System|
  :Compute dates and check feasibility\nagainst deadline and resources;
  if (Timeline feasible?) then (no)
    :Flag unrealistic deadline;
    |AI Supervisor|
    :Recommend adjustments;
    |Student or Team Leader|
    :Review flag and adjust inputs;
  else (yes)
    |Student or Team Leader|
    :Review timeline;
  endif
repeat while (Timeline approved?) is (no)
|System|
:Store approved timeline and methodology;
stop
@enduml
